#: git-sync:24
msgid ""
"Usage: %s <command> [remote ...]\\n\\nCommands:\\n  push [REMOTE ...]  Push "
"the current branch to the specified remotes; push to all remotes when "
"omitted\\n  status [REMOTE ...] Show the sync status of the specified "
"remotes\\n  help               Show this help\\n\\nExamples:\\n  %s push\\n  "
"%s push github gitlab\\n  %s status\\n"
msgstr ""
"用法：%s <命令> [远程仓库 ...]\\n\\n命令：\\n  push [REMOTE ...]  将当前分支推送到指定 remote；未指定时推送全部 "
"remote\\n  status [REMOTE ...] 查看指定 remote 的同步状态\\n  help               显示帮助"
"\\n\\n示例：\\n  %s push\\n  %s push github gitlab\\n  %s status\\n"

#: git-sync:29
msgid "The current directory is not a Git repository."
msgstr "当前目录不是 Git 仓库。"

#: git-sync:41
msgid "The current Git repository has no remotes."
msgstr "当前 Git 仓库没有配置 remote。"

